--- OLD
    SEC
    SBC #$01              ; otherwise, subtract 1 from the X coord
    STA str_buf+2, Y      ; and write it back
--- NEW
    SEC
    SBC OPTD_LINEUP       ; otherwise, step the X coord left.  This loop stops
    STA str_buf+2, Y      ;  on BCC, so the step need not divide the distance.
